OL,3,GNEWSAThree dead, including child, in
OL,4,AChannel crossing attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old child and two 30-year-old
OL,7,Fwomen have died after a small boat that
OL,8,Fwas attempting to cross the English
OL,9,FChannel got into difficulty off the
OL,10,Fnorthern coast of France, French
OL,11,Fauthorities say.
OL,13,FAuthorities said they responded to a
OL,14,Fdistress call from the boat, which was
OL,15,Fcarrying 105 people, after it departed
OL,16,Ffrom Bleriot Plage beach in Calais on
OL,17,FMonday morning.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
