OL,3,GNEWSAThree dead, including child, in
OL,4,AChannel crossing attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree passengers were treated on board
OL,7,Fbut were later confirmed dead by an
OL,8,Femergency medical team flown out by
OL,9,Fhelicopter, the French Maritime
OL,10,FPrefecture of the Channel and the North
OL,11,FSea said.
OL,13,FAround 100 passengers were brought to
OL,14,Fthe port of Calais afterwards, AFP news
OL,15,Fagency reported.
